# The battle with the troll is random and you have
# to keep fighting him until you knock him out.
# Your last hit will kill him. The more damage you
# take, the more time it takes to recover, which can
# impact your inventory limit. So this seed makes
# sure the troll is dispatched quickly.

kill troll
kill troll
